484	     2	// document's modules and the rename journal (spec §11 G-27, G-28, G-29).
485	     3	//
486	     4	// **On disk**, inside `graphics/`:
487	     5	// `history/<name>/<%06d sequence>-<revision>.js` is one kept text — the next
488	     6	// sequence is the highest plus one, and any other file there is ignored —
489	     7	// and `history/renames.json` is a JSON array of `[a, b]` pairs (the app
490	     8	// moved the file FROM `a` TO `b`; the repair only ever moves it back, G-28
491	     9	// (e)), oldest first, at most `renameJournalLimit`, a repeated unordered
492	    10	// pair moved to the end. Both are user content carried by every save (spec
493	    11	// §5.6), never a cache.
494	    12	//
495	    13	// **`history/` is created only inside an existing `graphics/`** (G-14:
496	    14	// `ensureFolder()` stays the one creator of the folder), with no
497	    15	// `packageContentsDidChangeOnDisk()` call — `fonts/`'s precedent in
498	    16	// `GraphicStore+Import.swift`.
499	    17	//
500	    18	// **History never holds the current text.** `keepReplaced`, which a pass
501	    19	// calls on the store's queue before it stores its scan, keeps the bytes a
502	    20	// module's new text replaced and drops the new text's own revision; a
503	    21	// text kept twice is listed once, and the lowest sequences past
504	    22	// `historyLimit` are pruned. Nothing is kept at `start()`, for a removal
505	    23	// the app did not make, or for a text that came and went inside one pass;
506	    24	// `start()` DROPS each module's current revision from its history (a text
507	    25	// put back while the project was closed), which is a drop and not a keep.
508	    26	//
509	    27	// **A file-less name with kept revisions is a DELETED module** (G-27 (f);
510	    28	// a rename killed part-way leaves the same state: G-28 (f)): `moveHistory`
511	    29	// leaves no `history/<from>/` behind, which is what makes that test sound
512	    30	// for `ProjectDocument.reconcileGraphicNames()`.
513	    31	
514	    32	import CryptoKit
515	    33	import Foundation
